  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1302.05 “Practitioner” or “licensed practitioner” means “practitioner” or “licensed practitioner” as defined in RSA 318:1, XV, namely, “means any person who is lawfully entitled to prescribe, administer, dispense, or distribute legend drugs to patients.”\n\nSource. #9552, eff 9-23-09; ss by #10185, eff 9-18-12; ss by #13558, eff 4-12-23 (formerly Ph 1302.03)",
